TYPES.md §15: a bare `self` in a field default reads every field, the field itself and later ones included: E3010, in a string interpolation and as a value alike.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record R {
  port: Int = 80
  me: String = "{self}"
  same: Bool = self == self
}
